+
+\* @invariant ContextContainsOnlyPassedPublishedData
+ContextContainsOnlyPassedPublishedData ==
+  \A g \in Graphs:
+    context_items[g] \subseteq passed_nodes[g]
+
+\* @invariant EveryAttemptGetsOneEnvelope
+EveryAttemptGetsOneEnvelope ==
+  \A g \in Graphs:
