+Next ==
+  \/ ScaffoldProject
+  \/ \E g \in Graphs:
+      RegisterGraph(g)
+  \/ \E g \in Graphs, n \in Nodes:
+      AddExplicitNode(g, n)
+  \/ \E n \in Nodes, d \in Nodes:
