+  /\ UNCHANGED side_effect_vars
+  /\ UNCHANGED provisioning_vars
+
+\* @command AddScriptDependency
+\* @result WorkflowResult
+\* @port TestGraphProgramPort.add_script_dependency
+AddScriptDependency(n, d) ==
